ib/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/deployments","created_at":"2019-07-02T16:47:21Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T17:11:15Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-05T17:00:27Z","git_url":"git://github.com/amethyst/bracket-lib.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:amethyst/bracket-lib.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/amethyst/bracket-lib.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/amethyst/bracket-lib","homepage":null,"size":10060,"stargazers_count":1645,"watchers_count":1645,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":125,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":105,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["amethyst-support","cp437","crates","retrogaming","rltk","roguelike","rust-crate","rust-crates"],"visibility":"public","forks":125,"open_issues":105,"watchers":1645,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Hey just wanted to share some feedback while poking around in the bevy branch!\r\n\r\nFirst off, on exiting of the program, bracket-bevy seems to throw an error on unwrapping of the window in the mouse system \r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nlet (camera, camera_transform) = q_camera.single();\r\n    let wnd = if let RenderTarget::Window(id) = camera.target {\r\n        wnds.get(id).unwrap()\r\n    } else {\r\n        wnds.get_primary().unwrap()\r\n    };\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhich is odd since bracket-bevy is just a plug-in of systems running in bevy so I would think bevy wouldn't update the system on app exit. A quick google search didn't lead me down and successive results on why the system would still run.\r\n\r\n~~Point 2: it seems that when importing bracket-bevy, and bevy as specific git branches, I am clashing when importing bracket-pathfinding. When implementing base map or alrogithm2D, the compiler is complaining that two different versions of bracket-geometry are being used. Pretty odd since they are locked at the same version.~~\r\n\r\nI plan to continue to mess around with the plug-in but would love to help out if you could use it!\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\n\r\nSorry im just dumb on point #2. I have to use the specific git branch for each bracket library. Silly me\r\n\r\nEdit #2: \r\nDid some more digging into the window unwrapping issue when the window is closed manually or by the `bevy::window::close_on_esc`. Seems bevy closes every window, and then once every window is closed, it then sends out the AppExit event which triggers the shutdown of the application. If you simple insert the `AppExit` event, everything shuts down cleanly without the error being produced.\r\n\r\n```\r\nfn main() {\r\n    App::new()\r\n        .add_plugins(DefaultPlugins)\r\n        .add_plugin(BTermBuilder::simple_80x50().with_random_number_generator(true))\r\n        .add_startup_system(setup)\r\n        .add_system(tick)\r\n        .add_system(exit_system)\r\n        .run();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfn exit_system(mut exit: EventWriter<AppExit>) {\r\n    exit.send(AppExit);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/issues/269/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amethyst/bracket-lib/issues/269/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"hakolao","id":12234005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM0MDA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12234005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakolao","html_url":"https://github.com/hakolao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakolao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakolao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakolao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakolao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakolao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakolao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakolao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakolao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hakolao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-09-21T17:11:22Z","updated_at":"2022-09-21T17:11:22Z","source":{"type":"issue","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/6049","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy","labels_url":"https://api.githu